    "description": "You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to designate one ally within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight that is currently <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grabbed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grabbed\">Grabbed</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grappled\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grappled\">Grappled</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Immobilized\" title=\"Immobilized\">Immobilized</a>; that target automatically escapes from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> (or the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Immobilization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immobilization\">Immobilization</a> effect is removed), and the target can move up to half its Speed immediately as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>.<br><br>This movement does not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>.",
